+## Repository sanitation — 2026-09-25
+
+Legacy D/Class-D pull requests that were already integrated, superseded by stronger current code, tied to spent D-200 launch identities, or incompatible with the locked Frozen-Candidate model were closed rather than merged back into current `main`: `#776`, `#741`, `#733`, `#724`, `#663`, `#652`, `#644`, `#637`, `#632`, `#546`, `#537`, `#484`, `#479`, `#401`, `#391` and `#735`.
