+PR `#735` remains historical design input only: current `main` already contains later parallel-host work, while its remaining unique phase-watchdog/deadline changes alter live cloud/runtime surfaces and therefore require a fresh Frozen Candidate plus live requalification before any future transplant. They were not silently imported during sanitation.
+
+The D-Series one-shot Swarm/Blockwise transport callers and provenance verifiers are required to bind to the immutable frozen source SHA and MUST NOT require `SOURCE_SHA == current main`. Historical PR evidence is bound only to immutable workflow execution SHA fields; mutable embedded pull-request head metadata is forbidden.
